  "description": "Tomas discovers that beneath a modern city there is an invisible magical network that keeps the balance between humans and magical creatures. When that balance starts to fall apart, he teams up with Lumi, a misunderstood magical creature, to look into weird anomalies that no one else seems to notice. As the mystery unfolds, Tomas learns that harmony between both worlds cannot be pushed through control, it has to be built with cooperation, trust, and living together.\n\nAn interactive storybook experience. A linear narrative adventure, perfect for young readers to enjoy a ripper of a story at their own pace.",
